cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MongoMasterPro, its reference dataset or its experiment harness, please cite it as below."
title: "MongoMasterPro: a reproducible MongoDB learning and experimentation platform"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Praveen
    given-names: Satvik
    email: satvikpraveen707@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/MongoMasterPro"
license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
keywords:
  - MongoDB
  - document databases
  - benchmarking
  - reproducible research
  - database education
abstract: >-
  MongoMasterPro packages a deterministic, checksummed synthetic e-learning
  dataset, eleven executable learning modules verified against MongoDB 6.0,
  7.0 and 8.0, and a benchmark harness that records raw per-trial samples with
  full environment provenance and analyses them with rank-based statistics.
